docs {
  ## Description
  Retrieve detailed Petrovis registration by ID, including all delegates and their information.

  ## Authentication
  - Bearer token required
  - Role: **Admin only**

  ## Path Parameters
  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
  |-----------|------|----------|-------------|
  | id | string(uuid) | Yes | Petrovis registration UUID |

  ## Response Structure
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "success to get detail Petrovis",
    "data": {
      "id": "c58a8a69-56a9-4c35-8a5f-9e95eae8b7ee",
      "spe": "SPE UI SC",
      "email": "adidin@gmail.com",
      "status": "paid",
      "delegates": [
        {
          "name": "Adidin bin ahmad",
          "phone_number": "6285333133515",
          "faculty": "FCC",
          "major": "Sastra Jaringan",
          "batch": "2024",
          "gender": "Male",
          "type": "LEADER",
          "scan_id": "https://s3.amazonaws.com/..."
        }
      ]
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Response Fields
  | Field | Type | Description |
  |-------|------|-------------|
  | id | string(uuid) | Unique identifier of the Petrovis registration |
  | spe | string | Name of the SPE organization |
  | email | string | Registration contact email |
  | status | string | Payment status (paid, pending, cancelled) |
  | delegates | array | Array of delegate objects (leader at index 0) |

  ### Delegate Fields
  | Field | Type | Description |
  |-------|------|-------------|
  | name | string | Full name of the delegate |
  | phone_number | string | Phone number |
  | faculty | string | Faculty name |
  | major | string | Major/Study program |
  | batch | string | Batch/year of study |
  | gender | string | Gender (Male/Female) |
  | type | string | Delegate type (LEADER or MEMBER) |
  | scan_id | string(url) | S3 URL to uploaded ID card scan |

  ## Error Responses
  | Status | Message |
  |--------|---------|
  | 400 | Invalid ID parameter format |
  | 401 | Unauthorized (missing or invalid token) |
  | 403 | Forbidden (not an admin) |
  | 404 | Petrovis ID not found |
  | 500 | Failed to get detail Petrovis |

  ## Business Logic Notes
  - First delegate (index 0) is always the LEADER
  - Subsequent delegates (if any) are MEMBER type
  - scan_id field contains the full S3 URL to the uploaded file
  - Validates existence of Petrovis registration, associated Tripay transaction, and SPE organization
}
